From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:03:12 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] /disguise: others see a random name and a bundled skin; the
 player sees their own

The tab list entry is built per viewer only where one carries a name (join, show, list name);
nothing runs per packet, and an undisguised player costs one null check. The skins ship with
the server already signed by Mojang, so disguising asks nobody anything.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

