+# Athena - the skins /disguise picks from: one per line, Mojang's signed textures property (value, signature) and the account it came from.
+# A 1.8 client shows another player's skin only with Mojang's signature, so a skin URL alone would not do. Fetched from
+# https://sessionserver.mojang.com/session/minecraft/profile/<uuid>?unsigned=false; the signature stays valid.
